@startuml diagrama_classes_eq
'============================================================
' PB31 - DIAGRAMA DE CLASSES
' Plugin de Equalizacao 24 bandas
' Fase 1: prototipo Python derivado do SelvaSonic (Sprints 1-2)
' Fase 2: producao nativa C++ / JUCE (Sprints 3-4)
'============================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #2F4858
skinparam classBorderColor #2F4858
skinparam packageBorderColor #7A8B99
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF6D9
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
hide empty members

title PB31 - Diagrama de Classes\nPrototipo Python (refatoracao do SelvaSonic) e Motor Nativo C++/JUCE

'------------------------------------------------------------
' TIPOS COMPARTILHADOS
'------------------------------------------------------------
package "Tipos compartilhados (contrato entre as duas fases)" <<Frame>> #FAFAFA {

  enum FilterType {
    PEAKING
    LOW_SHELF
    HIGH_SHELF
    LOW_CUT
    HIGH_CUT
    BAND_PASS
    NOTCH
    ALL_PASS
  }

  enum ChannelMode {
    STEREO
    LEFT
    RIGHT
    MID
    SIDE
  }

  enum Slope {
    S6
    S12
    S24
    S48
    S96
  }
}

'============================================================
' FASE 1 - PROTOTIPO PYTHON
'============================================================
package "FASE 1 - Prototipo Python (Sprints 1-2)" <<Frame>> #EEF4FB {

  '---------- NUCLEO DSP: PROIBIDO IMPORTAR UI (PB28) ----------
  package "eq.dsp  -- sem import de tkinter/matplotlib (PB28)" <<Frame>> #E3EDF7 {

    class EqConfig <<dataclass>> {
      +sample_rate : int = 44100
      +buffer_size : int = 512
      +input_device : Optional[str]
      +output_device : Optional[str]
      +num_bands : int = 24
      +ms_enabled : bool = False
      +oversampling : int = 1
      +last_audio_buffer : Optional[ndarray]
      --
      +validate() : None
      +__post_init__() : None
    }
    note right of EqConfig
      REAPROVEITA synth/config.py (SynthConfig).
      Mantem: sample_rate, buffer_size, validate(),
      last_audio_buffer.
      REMOVE: waveform, ADSR, LFO/HFO/FM, polifonia,
      wavetables, midi_port.
      PB29: sample_rate e sempre lido daqui,
      nunca constante no calculo.
    end note

    class BiquadMath <<module>> {
      .. RBJ Audio EQ Cookbook (PB05) ..
      +{static} peaking(fs, f0, gain_db, q) : Coeffs
      +{static} low_shelf(fs, f0, gain_db, s) : Coeffs
      +{static} high_shelf(fs, f0, gain_db, s) : Coeffs
      +{static} low_cut(fs, f0, q) : Coeffs
      +{static} high_cut(fs, f0, q) : Coeffs
      +{static} band_pass(fs, f0, q) : Coeffs
      +{static} notch(fs, f0, q) : Coeffs
      .. Cascateamento Butterworth 6..96 dB/oct ..
      +{static} butterworth_q_table(order) : List[float]
      +{static} cascade(fs, f0, slope, ftype) : List[Coeffs]
      .. Resposta teorica (PB09) ..
      +{static} freq_response(coeffs, fs, n=2048) : (w, h)
      +{static} combined_response(bands, fs) : ndarray
      -{static} _cached_coeffs(...) : Coeffs
    }
    note left of BiquadMath
      SUBSTITUI synth/filters.py:
      - get_filter_coeffs() usava scipy butter()
        de ordem fixa 2; aqui entram as equacoes
        RBJ completas, vetorizadas com NumPy.
      - MANTEM o padrao @lru_cache do original
        para nao recalcular coeficiente por frame.
      - apply_modulations() e DESCARTADO (era do synth).
    end note

    class Coeffs <<value object>> {
      +b0 : float
      +b1 : float
      +b2 : float
      +a1 : float
      +a2 : float
      +as_ba() : (ndarray, ndarray)
    }

    class EqBand {
      +index : int
      +freq_hz : float
      +gain_db : float
      +q : float
      +ftype : FilterType
      +slope : Slope
      +mode : ChannelMode
      +bypass : bool
      +solo : bool
      --
      -coeffs : List[Coeffs]
      -zi : ndarray
      --
      +recalculate(fs : int) : None
      +process(block : ndarray) : ndarray
      +reset_state() : None
      +to_dict() : dict
      +{static} from_dict(d) : EqBand
    }
    note bottom of EqBand
      Herda o padrao de estado continuo de
      synth/filters.py::apply_filter():
      guarda zi/zf entre blocos via lfilter_zi
      para eliminar clicks de descontinuidade.
      A diferenca: o estado vive na BANDA,
      nao mais no VoiceState.
    end note

    class EqEngine {
      -config : EqConfig
      -bands : List[EqBand]
      --
      +prepare(fs, block_size) : None
      +process(block : ndarray) : ndarray
      +add_band(...) : EqBand
      +remove_band(index : int) : None
      +set_param(index, name, value) : None
      +global_response(n=2048) : ndarray
      +reset_all() : None
      -_encode_mid_side(lr) : ndarray
      -_decode_mid_side(ms) : ndarray
      -_active_bands() : List[EqBand]
    }
    note right of EqEngine
      PB04: lista dimensionada para 24 bandas.
      PB22: M = (L+R)/2 ; S = (L-R)/2.
      PB12: _active_bands() resolve solo/bypass.
    end note

    class AudioIO {
      +stream : sd.Stream
      +running : bool
      +visual_queue : Queue
      -config : EqConfig
      -engine : EqEngine
      --
      +start() : None
      +stop() : None
      +restart_stream() : None
      +audio_callback(indata, outdata, frames, time, status)
      +peak_dbfs(block) : float
      +is_clipping(block) : bool
      +__enter__() / __exit__()
    }
    note left of AudioIO
      REAPROVEITA synth/synth.py (MidiSynth) +
      synth/audio.py (audio_callback):
      - sd.OutputStream vira sd.Stream (duplex):
        a fonte deixa de ser generate_wave()
        e passa a ser mic / WAV (PB01, PB02).
      - visual_queue (Queue maxsize=2) do original
        e MANTIDA: ja e o padrao produtor/consumidor
        que vira LockFreeQueue no C++.
      - np.tanh() de soft clip vira detector de
        pico > 0 dBFS (PB20).
      - midi_callback e VoiceManager: REMOVIDOS.
    end note

    class SpectrumFFT {
      -fft_size : int
      -window : ndarray
      -ring : ndarray
      --
      +push_block(block : ndarray) : None
      +magnitudes_db() : ndarray
      +bin_to_hz(bin : int) : float
      +set_smoothing(alpha : float) : None
      -_apply_window(frame) : ndarray
    }
    note right of SpectrumFFT
      SUBSTITUI ui/visuals.py:
      - generate_static_wave() e DESCARTADA
        (dependia de WaveType e wavetables).
      - o consumo de blocos da visual_queue e
        a plotagem matplotlib sao MANTIDOS;
        entra scipy.fft + conversao dB (PB08).
    end note

    class PresetIO <<module>> {
      +{static} save_preset(engine, filename) : None
      +{static} load_preset(engine, filename) : None
      +{static} enum_to_str(obj) : str
      +{static} to_dict(engine) : dict
    }
    note bottom of PresetIO
      REAPROVEITA synth/file_io.py quase intacto:
      save_config/load_config + enum_to_str ja
      serializam dataclass -> JSON.
      Atende provisoriamente PB14.
    end note
  }

  '---------- CAMADA DE UI DE TESTE ----------
  package "eq.ui  -- depende do DSP, nunca o inverso" <<Frame>> #F3E9F7 {

    class EqInterface {
      -master : tk.Tk
      -engine : EqEngine
      -io : AudioIO
      -analyzer : SpectrumFFT
      -nodes : List[BandNode]
      --
      +_build_header() : None
      +_build_curve_area() : None
      +_build_band_panel() : None
      +setup_visuals() : None
      +update_visuals() : None
      +start_visual_updates() : None
      +draw_log_axes() : None
      +draw_theoretical_curve() : None
      +draw_spectrum() : None
      +show_clip_indicator(state) : None
      +save_preset_dialog() : None
      +load_preset_dialog() : None
      +update_sample_rate(event) : None
      +update_buffer_size(event) : None
      +on_close() : None
    }
    note left of EqInterface
      REAPROVEITA ui/interface.py (FullSynthInterface):
      - o loop update_visuals() + start_visual_updates()
        via root.after() e o canvas matplotlib
        sao MANTIDOS integralmente.
      - restart_audio_stream(), update_sample_rate(),
        update_buffer_size(): reaproveitados (PB29).
      - abas de oscilador/ADSR/modulacao/polifonia
        e o teclado virtual: REMOVIDOS.
    end note

    class BandNode {
      +band_index : int
      +x_px : float
      +y_px : float
      --
      +hit_test(px, py) : bool
      +drag_to(px, py) : None
      +on_wheel(delta) : None
      +toggle_solo() : None
      +toggle_bypass() : None
    }
    note bottom of BandNode
      PB21: arrastar = freq (X) + ganho (Y);
      roda do mouse = fator Q.
    end note

    class BandControls <<module>> {
      +{static} update_band_type(engine, i, value)
      +{static} update_band_freq(engine, i, value, label)
      +{static} update_band_gain(engine, i, value, label)
      +{static} update_band_q(engine, i, value, label)
      +{static} update_band_mode(engine, i, value)
    }
    note right of BandControls
      REFATORA ui/controls/filter_controls.py:
      as 3 funcoes update_filter_* passam a
      receber o indice da banda e escrever
      na EqBand em vez do SynthConfig global.
    end note

    class SelvaSlider <<tk.Canvas>> {
      +from_ : float
      +to_ : float
      +value : float
      +command : Callable
      --
      +set(value) : None
      +_on_drag(event) : None
    }
    note bottom of SelvaSlider
      REAPROVEITADO de ui/widgets.py sem alteracao.
      Usado nos controles numericos das bandas.
    end note
  }
}

'============================================================
' FASE 2 - PRODUCAO NATIVA C++ / JUCE
'============================================================
package "FASE 2 - Producao Nativa C++ / JUCE (Sprints 3-4)" <<Frame>> #EAF6EE {

  '---------- AUDIO THREAD ----------
  package "cpp.dsp -- Audio Thread: sem new, sem lock (PB10/PB26/PB27)" <<Frame>> #DFF0E4 {

    class BiquadFilter <<SIMD>> {
      -coeffs : juce::dsp::IIR::Coefficients
      -filter : juce::dsp::IIR::Filter<float>
      --
      +prepare(spec : ProcessSpec) : void
      +setCoefficients(c) : void
      +process(context) : void
      +reset() : void
      +snapToZero() : void
    }

    class EqBandNative {
      +index : int
      +type : FilterType
      +mode : ChannelMode
      +slope : Slope
      --
      -freq : ParameterSmoother
      -gain : ParameterSmoother
      -q : ParameterSmoother
      -filters : std::array<BiquadFilter, 8>
      -bypassed : std::atomic<bool>
      -soloed : std::atomic<bool>
      --
      +prepare(spec) : void
      +updateCoefficients(fs) : void
      +process(context) : void
      +reset() : void
    }

    class ParameterSmoother {
      -current : float
      -target : float
      -coeff : float
      --
      +setTimeConstant(ms, fs) : void
      +setTarget(v) : void
      +getNextValue() : float
      +isSmoothing() : bool
    }
    note right of ParameterSmoother
      One-pole lowpass. Elimina zipper noise
      e clicks, inclusive na entrada e saida
      do modo Bypass (PB16).
    end note

    class Oversampler {
      -os : juce::dsp::Oversampling<float>
      --
      +setFactor(x : int) : void
      +processSamplesUp(block) : Block
      +processSamplesDown(block) : void
      +getLatencyInSamples() : float
    }
    note bottom of Oversampler
      PB11 - decramping: corrige o warping
      das bandas proximas a Nyquist.
    end note

    class LockFreeQueue <<juce::AbstractFifo>> {
      -fifo : juce::AbstractFifo
      -storage : std::vector<float>
      --
      +push(data, numSamples) : bool
      +pop(dest, numSamples) : int
      +getFreeSpace() : int
      +reset() : void
    }
    note left of LockFreeQueue
      Equivalente nativo da visual_queue
      (queue.Queue) do SelvaSonic, agora sem
      lock e sem alocacao.
    end note

    class PluginProcessor <<juce::AudioProcessor>> {
      +apvts : AudioProcessorValueTreeState
      -bands : std::array<EqBandNative, 24>
      -fifo : LockFreeQueue
      -oversampler : Oversampler
      -clipDetected : std::atomic<bool>
      --
      +prepareToPlay(fs, blockSize) : void
      +processBlock(buffer, midi) : void
      +releaseResources() : void
      +getStateInformation(destData) : void
      +setStateInformation(data, size) : void
      +createEditor() : AudioProcessorEditor*
      -encodeMidSide(buffer) : void
      -decodeMidSide(buffer) : void
    }
    note left of PluginProcessor
      Dono absoluto do motor DSP.
      PROIBIDO dentro de processBlock:
      new / malloc / std::mutex / I-O de arquivo.
      Metas: CPU < 5% (PB23) e latencia
      menor ou igual ao buffer da DAW (PB24).
    end note
  }

  '---------- THREAD DE ANALISE ----------
  package "cpp.analysis -- Thread secundaria" <<Frame>> #E6F0F7 {
    class FftAnalyzer <<juce::Thread>> {
      -fft : juce::dsp::FFT
      -window : juce::dsp::WindowingFunction<float>
      -fifoRef : LockFreeQueue&
      -magnitudes : std::array<float, 1024>
      --
      +run() : void
      +getMagnitudesDb() : const float*
      +setFftOrder(order : int) : void
    }
  }

  '---------- MESSAGE THREAD ----------
  package "cpp.ui -- Message Thread a 60 FPS (PB25)" <<Frame>> #F3E9F7 {

    class PluginEditor <<juce::AudioProcessorEditor, juce::Timer>> {
      -processor : PluginProcessor&
      -curve : InteractiveCurve
      -stateCtrl : StateController
      --
      +paint(g) : void
      +resized() : void
      +timerCallback() : void
    }

    class InteractiveCurve <<juce::Component>> {
      -nodes : std::array<BandNodeNative, 24>
      --
      +paint(g) : void
      +drawTheoreticalCurve(g) : void
      +drawSpectrum(g) : void
      +drawLogGrid(g) : void
      +mouseDown(e) : void
      +mouseDrag(e) : void
      +mouseWheelMove(e, wheel) : void
    }

    class BandNodeNative <<juce::Component>> {
      +bandIndex : int
      -freqAttachment : SliderAttachment
      -gainAttachment : SliderAttachment
      -qAttachment : SliderAttachment
      --
      +mouseDrag(e) : void
      +toggleSolo() : void
      +toggleBypass() : void
    }

    class StateController {
      -undoManager : juce::UndoManager
      -slotA : ValueTree
      -slotB : ValueTree
      --
      +beginTransaction(name) : void
      +undo() : void
      +redo() : void
      +storeA() : void
      +storeB() : void
      +compareAB() : void
    }

    class PresetManager {
      +save(name : String) : void
      +load(file : juce::File) : void
      +listPresets() : StringArray
      +exportXml() : XmlElement
    }
    note right of PresetManager
      PB13 / PB14 / PB15: serializacao XML da
      arvore APVTS no file system do SO.
    end note
  }
}

'------------------------------------------------------------
' RELACOES - PYTHON
'------------------------------------------------------------
EqEngine "1" *-- "0..24" EqBand
EqEngine --> EqConfig
EqBand ..> BiquadMath
EqBand "1" *-- "1..8" Coeffs
EqBand --> FilterType
EqBand --> ChannelMode
EqBand --> Slope
AudioIO --> EqEngine
AudioIO --> EqConfig
AudioIO ..> SpectrumFFT : visual_queue
EqInterface --> EqEngine
EqInterface --> AudioIO
EqInterface --> SpectrumFFT
EqInterface "1" *-- "0..24" BandNode
EqInterface ..> BandControls
EqInterface ..> SelvaSlider
BandControls ..> EqEngine
PresetIO ..> EqEngine

'------------------------------------------------------------
' RELACOES - C++
'------------------------------------------------------------
PluginProcessor "1" *-- "24" EqBandNative
PluginProcessor *-- "1" LockFreeQueue
PluginProcessor *-- "1" Oversampler
PluginProcessor --> FilterType
EqBandNative "1" *-- "1..8" BiquadFilter
EqBandNative "1" *-- "3" ParameterSmoother
EqBandNative --> ChannelMode
EqBandNative --> Slope
FftAnalyzer --> LockFreeQueue
PluginEditor --> PluginProcessor : APVTS
PluginEditor *-- InteractiveCurve
PluginEditor *-- StateController
PluginEditor ..> FftAnalyzer
InteractiveCurve "1" *-- "24" BandNodeNative
StateController ..> PresetManager

'------------------------------------------------------------
' PORTABILIDADE PYTHON -> C++ (PB30)
'------------------------------------------------------------
BiquadMath    -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  BiquadFilter     : porta para
EqBand        -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  EqBandNative     : porta para
EqEngine      -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  PluginProcessor  : porta para
AudioIO       -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  PluginProcessor  : porta para
SpectrumFFT   -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  FftAnalyzer      : porta para
EqInterface   -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  PluginEditor     : porta para
BandNode      -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  BandNodeNative   : porta para
PresetIO      -[#9B59B6,dashed]->  PresetManager    : porta para

legend bottom
  |= Cor |= Significado |
  | <#E3EDF7> | Nucleo DSP Python - zero dependencia grafica (PB28) |
  | <#DFF0E4> | Audio Thread C++ - realtime safe (PB26/PB27) |
  | <#E6F0F7> | Thread de analise FFT |
  | <#F3E9F7> | Camada de interface |
  | roxo tracejado | Traducao da Sprint 2 para a Sprint 3 (PB30) |
endlegend

@enduml
